{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "heading",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 920,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "# 이메일 인증번호 발급\n\nPOST /api/v1/auth/email-verifications"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 150,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 255,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "### 01  요청 · 목적 검사\n\nJSON을 읽고 허용 필드 확인\n\nPIN 목적은 로그인 먼저 확인\n\n[[analysis/2026-11-15-codebase/DodamDodam-Code-Map/Classes/auth.api.EmailVerificationController#issue m90c67bb20e0ca690|issue()]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 150,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 255,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "### 02  정규화 · 예산 예약\n\n이메일·목적별 제한 예약\n\n6자리 번호 생성과 HMAC\n\n[[analysis/2026-11-15-codebase/DodamDodam-Code-Map/Classes/auth.application.EmailVerificationIssuanceService#issue mcb0a83ce2cd55ce0|issue()]] · [[analysis/2026-11-15-codebase/DodamDodam-Code-Map/Classes/auth.application.AuthRateLimitService#reserve m63e1737a4e336ba7|reserve()]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 255,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "### 03  목적별 현재 상태 확인\n\n공개 목적: 계정 적격 여부\n\nPIN 목적: 현재 문맥·PIN 잠금\n\n[[analysis/2026-11-15-codebase/DodamDodam-Code-Map/Classes/auth.application.EmailVerificationIssuanceService#preparePublic m8348ca544b936e88|preparePublic()]] · [[analysis/2026-11-15-codebase/DodamDodam-Code-Map/Classes/auth.application.EmailVerificationIssuanceService#preparePin m330c48cfa5c13034|preparePin()]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 255,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "### 04  challenge 저장 · 커밋\n\n이전 증명을 무효화\n\n새 발급과 만료 시각 저장\n\n[[analysis/2026-11-15-codebase/DodamDodam-Code-Map/Classes/auth.infrastructure.EmailVerificationRepository#replace m14c7e6b25ddbfbd4|replace()]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 255,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "### 05  메일 전달\n\n업무 트랜잭션 밖에서 SMTP\n\n실패하면 이 발급만 폐기\n\n[[analysis/2026-11-15-codebase/DodamDodam-Code-Map/Classes/auth.application.EmailVerificationDeliveryService#deliver mce05e4112cdb91d4|deliver()]] · [[analysis/2026-11-15-codebase/DodamDodam-Code-Map/Classes/auth.infrastructure.SmtpEmailVerificationSender#send mbb7d859c7dfa3045|send()]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 255,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "### 06  응답 권한 재확인\n\n현재 proof·문맥·PIN 재검사\n\n보낼 때도 최신 상태 확인\n\n[[analysis/2026-11-15-codebase/DodamDodam-Code-Map/Classes/auth.application.EmailVerificationIssuanceService#verifyResponseAccess me8292ce668aadbdf|verifyResponseAccess()]] · [[analysis/2026-11-15-codebase/DodamDodam-Code-Map/Classes/auth.session.AuthStateErrorFilter#verifyResponseAccess m1098528f38d3ff11|verifyResponseAccess()]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "legend",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1050,
      "width": 920,
      "height": 55,
      "text": "번호 순서로 읽기 · 주요 처리 순서 요약 · 직접 호출·분기 전체는 연결된 메서드 노트에서 확인"
    }
  ],
